From: Iscle <albertiscle9@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 18:58:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 06/10] ir: Add a HAL for the SPI IR transmitter

Some Xiaomi devices drive their IR LED from a SPI controller through
/dev/ir_spi instead of a lirc device. The kernel clocks the buffer it is
given out to the LED one bit per clock, so the HAL renders each burst
into that bitmap, with the same carrier, duty cycle and timing as
Xiaomi's consumerir HAL.

